      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that uploads a file or byte stream to a managed object storage service. I will use AWS S3 as the concrete external provider for this task. The script will include the necessary imports and provider-specific code to identify the integration with AWS S3. </thinking>\n",
